{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0JvbGx5d29vZC8xOTkxLS0yMDAwL0pvcnUlMjBLYSUyMEdodWxhbSUyMCUyODIwMDAlMjkv","type":"movie","name":"Joru Ka Ghulam","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/lqukWizp1euDvBjfx7FNFsQt5sp.jpg","description":"Dhaneshwar Pitamber, has four daughters. All the four daughters are not ready to marry, each one having their own reason. The daughters always play mischievous tricks on the one coming with a proposal of marriage, and their gang leader is the youngest daughter Durga. Kader Khan is so desperate to get his daughters married that he is ready to give a dowry of five crores to each son-in-law. Raja and Kanahaiya are small time con men at the airport. Raju Patel is an NRI from America who comes to India to get married to one of the daughters of Dhaneshwar.","releaseInfo":"2000","genres":["Bollywood"],"imdbRating":"5.6","runtime":"162 min","cast":["Govinda","Twinkle Khanna","Kader Khan","Ashok Saraf","Ashish Vidhyarthi","Ali Asgar","Razak Khan","Rakhi Sawant"],"director":["Shakeel Noorani"],"released":"2000-06-15T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Govinda","character":"Raja","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/jIY8akWgvhgbIgZDd20yIPFDSv8.jpg"},{"name":"Twinkle Khanna","character":"Durga","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ipAV6rBOkJQhTW5Zs8phZWGmXMt.jpg"},{"name":"Kader Khan","character":"Dyaneshwarprasad Pitamber","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/gf0v2N4xKNGDfHN5lxk7yxUEYQ3.jpg"},{"name":"Ashok Saraf","character":"P.K. Girpade","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/mcX2Bi9eNl0nkZjVFtcjbhQyXja.jpg"},{"name":"Ashish Vidhyarthi","character":"Pappu Anna","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/iBUUpfHZIfpC5afHrHwcyGTHKQF.jpg"},{"name":"Ali Asgar","character":"Raju Patel","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/a1D5cJMDWTnREMaUcer9oARZWnB.jpg"},{"name":"Razak Khan","character":"Fida Hussain","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/cyfZyIApQK0eOrOeoyTgAl0U3EQ.jpg"},{"name":"Rakh